Here are **test prompts grouped by each WayFinder Agent job**, covering both standard (happy path) and a few edge or fallback cases to help you test thoroughly:

---

### 🧠 **Job #1 – Knowledge Answers (FAQs, Self-Help)**

**✅ Happy Path:**

* “How do I reset my ATLAS password?”
* “Where can I find my Explanation of Benefits?”
* “Is there a guide to submitting a new claim?”
* “How do I update my organization’s contact details?”
* “What is the process to set up auto-pay?”

**⚠️ Edge/Fallback Cases:**

* “I need help but don’t know what to search.”
* “Explain everything about ATLAS.”
* “Why is my payment missing?” (might get misrouted if not clearly AR-related)

---

### 🎓 **Job #2 – Recommend Webinars**

**✅ Happy Path:**

* “Are there any upcoming webinars on claim workflows?”
* “Suggest an on-demand webinar for AR topics.”
* “Do you have webinars about payment reconciliation?”
* “What training sessions are available for new clients?”
* “I want to learn more about denial management.”

**⚠️ Edge/Fallback Cases:**

* “Schedule a webinar for me.” (Agent should redirect or clarify)
* “Can I get a Zoom link for next week’s session?” (Check if handled)
* “Record my attendance for the last webinar.”

---

### 💰 **Job #3 – Accounts Receivable (Invoice Status, Billing Help)**

**✅ Happy Path:**

* “What’s the status of invoice INV-12345?”
* “Why is invoice INV-56789 still unpaid?”
* “Show me all open invoices.”
* “Is invoice INV-78910 marked as overdue?”
* “Can I download the invoice copy?”

**⚠️ Edge/Fallback Cases:**

* “Tell me all invoices for the year.” (Too broad)
* “Update invoice status to paid.” (Agent should not allow)
* “I forgot my invoice number.” (Should suggest help)

---

### 📥 **Job #4 – Missing Remits / Internal Support**

**✅ Happy Path:**

* “I didn’t receive a remittance for REF-98765.”
* “Why is the payment amount different from the deposit?”
* “Check if a remittance was sent for this payment.”
* “Help me log a ticket for a missing remittance.”
* “There’s no EOB attached to this transaction.”

**⚠️ Edge/Fallback Cases:**

* “Generate a full payment report.” (Out of scope)
* “Email me the remittance.” (Should route appropriately or guide)
* “Something’s wrong with my money.” (Too vague—agent should prompt for more)

